                "нет",
                "ни",
                "не",
                "но"
              ],
              "answer": "не",
              "hint": "Negation particle before the verb.",
              "explanation": "Не goes directly before the verb: Я не понимаю."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "_____ не знает ответ. (Nobody knows the answer.)",
              "promptEnglish": "Nobody knows the answer.",
              "options": [
