                "не",
                "ни",
                "но"
              ],
              "answer": "не",
              "hint": "Не negates the possessive.",
              "explanation": "Не can negate nouns and possessives too: Это не моя книга."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "— Ты студент? — _____.",
              "promptEnglish": "Are you a student? No.",
              "options": [
